                                "sense_id": "08a85ab9-87aa-3e54-91fd-c38f6c241e89",
                                "text": "э́то бы́ло причи́ной того́, что его́ здоро́вье пошатну́лось",
                                "translation": "it has been a shock to his system; his health has suffered",
                                "english": "it has been a shock to his system; his health has suffered"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07c21ec6-9e32-4ca5-9efe-9e4e27cf8d1c",
                                "sense_id": "08a85ab9-87aa-3e54-91fd-c38f6c241e89",
                                "text": "его́ уве́ренность пошатну́лась",
                                "translation": "he was shaken in his confidence",
                                "english": "he was shaken in his confidence"
                            }
